Added a "Skip to main content" bypass link to all base templates so that keyboard and screen reader users can jump past the navigation sidebar (WCAG 2.4.1).
Added live regions so that messages appended via HTMX and pagination range changes are announced by screen readers.
Added an accessible name and fallback content to rack elevations, which previously offered no text alternative to the embedded SVG.
Added axe-core accessibility regression tests covering the home page, object list, detail, edit and error-state form, search and login pages, gating on the WCAG 2.2 Level A and AA rule tags.
